79 |   as_value puts(1)
   |   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `as_value` expands here
  ::: tests/ui/macro_errors.wid:28:18
   |
28 |     result = 1 + #{steps}
   |                  -------- this splice is a `[]Code`
help: a list splices only where a list goes: alone on a line, or among call arguments or array elements
