error[E0323]: the macro `outer` cannot be used as a proc
  --> tests/ui/macro_errors.wid:88:14
   |
12 | macro def outer -> Code
   |           ----- declared as a `macro def` here
...
88 |   f = method(:outer)
   |              ^^^^^^ a macro runs while compiling and leaves code behind
   = note: a proc is a method the program calls while it runs; a macro has no such method
help: call `outer` where its code should go, or write a `def` that a proc can name
